s for Scotland\'s economic development and governance.\n\nOverall, I scored the article low on historical and cultural interest, but moderately interesting on quirky interest and some aspects of economic and political importance.', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'context': [128006, 9125, 128007, 271, 38766, 1303, 33025, 2696, 25, 6790, 220, 2366, 18, 271, 128009, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 2675, 527, 42118, 3754, 9908, 369, 264, 27188, 28948, 323, 7829, 20846, 449, 264, 15871, 2326, 12, 3407, 2469, 41470, 71764, 10877, 482, 1274, 315, 27188, 38052, 5496, 304, 279, 3723, 4273, 11, 7008, 11, 8494, 11, 323, 1023, 5961, 889, 10519, 459, 2802, 304, 279, 3925, 323, 7829, 315, 872, 330, 820, 3224, 11690, 52157, 264, 14595, 6742, 25, 4423, 315, 27188, 38052, 5496, 304, 279, 2326, 11, 449, 3070, 13537, 311, 19627, 11, 8173, 304, 6975, 922, 279, 330, 820, 3224, 1, 482, 1202, 3925, 11, 7829, 11, 32006, 11, 323, 19225, 26006, 430, 5030, 382, 17064, 11106, 25, 36002, 21878, 21348, 8625, 304, 586, 6206, 439, 78631, 34145, 704, 198, 3222, 25, 3788, 1129, 2185, 960, 9081, 916, 28455, 55134, 2971, 89835, 80, 23, 75, 18, 85, 23812, 78, 30, 266, 55967, 28, 70080, 5, 266, 59661, 32220, 784, 271, 17064, 9059, 320, 3983, 220, 1049, 15, 23861, 997, 47, 4014, 21878, 21348, 690, 7293, 304, 586, 15637, 1306, 279, 15236, 78631, 369, 1202, 6412, 13541, 704, 315, 279, 4401, 13, 362, 8518, 3568, 1047, 1027, 51578, 1990, 279, 27188, 3109, 323, 279, 78631, 482, 889, 8625, 22939, 482, 6931, 420, 1060, 13, 4452, 11, 32724, 5629, 9675, 30301, 48381, 11007, 279, 3284, 64310, 1047, 21536, 1555, 304, 264, 6661, 311, 19229, 299, 347, 596, 8752, 323, 6762, 990, 13093, 13, 578, 27188, 3109, 706, 1027, 4560, 311, 4662, 279, 17149, 369, 3892, 1667, 11, 3515, 4529, 433, 927, 505, 1561, 17340, 14054, 7626, 763, 1658, 266, 321, 304, 220, 679, 18, 13, 48381, 1071, 1364, 574, 25406, 922, 279, 6412, 16054, 1555, 11, 719, 430, 8518, 5178, 315, 36002, 21878, 574, 15098, 3831, 11, 9523, 311, 40880, 264, 13651, 3