 government decisions, which are relevant to diaspora Scots interested in Scottish politics.\n\nOverall, I scored this article lowly because it lacks significant historical context and relevance to Scottish heritage/culture from a diaspora perspective.","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","context":[128006,9125,128007,271,38766,1303,33025,2696,25,6790,220,2366,18,271,128009,128006,882,128007,271,2675,527,42118,3754,9908,369,264,27188,28948,323,7829,20846,449,264,15871,2326,12,3407,2469,41470,71764,10877,482,1274,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,3723,4273,11,7008,11,8494,11,323,1023,5961,889,10519,459,2802,304,279,3925,323,7829,315,872,330,820,3224,11690,52157,264,14595,6742,25,4423,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,2326,11,449,3070,13537,311,19627,11,8173,304,6975,922,279,330,820,3224,1,482,1202,3925,11,7829,11,32006,11,323,19225,26006,430,5030,382,17064,11106,25,2650,32532,82852,6,28368,374,13419,279,93050,81583,21411,63237,198,3222,25,3788,1129,2185,7840,2469,1543,916,85928,51426,3880,15113,12,770,2396,95852,31530,12934,9585,10826,31419,94707,56432,71804,2427,820,268,2427,14070,12,21791,15901,17,271,17064,9059,320,3983,220,1049,15,23861,997,2181,753,3062,584,656,4395,584,649,311,1862,93050,1254,71804,2476,1071,12801,9675,6746,404,7834,1195,258,279,29707,315,26667,4345,1566,2046,13,6984,287,279,6560,753,8706,3691,323,7172,7637,11,832,430,3727,709,7083,18,304,1475,7083,1041,315,19627,753,8752,11,12899,304,13937,315,220,1272,11,931,7032,11,323,264,3789,315,5788,323,44202,304,10977,6957,279,3224,11,1053,2873,1093,1695,5647,369,279,25554,10423,13,67102,67102,1115,2046,11,4869,11,279,48063,12886,2500,12523,311,279,93050,81583,5064,555,38787,264,4726,3827,35331,389,31739,1389,279,4948,304,2380,1667,13,1102,3445,430,3827,389,31739,1093,93050,706,1457,41482,555,264,55944,220,1114,13,20,824,2960,2533,6287,220,2366,18,13,11697,420,19543,304,1765,3252,6650,323,75720,519,3827,57580,30,578,14329,13,8155,2046,433,574,10675,430,31739,13254,374,1523,555,220,22,824,2960,304,279,1176,8254,4038,