2025-11-27 14:03:25,218 - app.llm.services - DEBUG - [REQUESTS] Request body: b'{"model": "llama3.2:latest", "prompt": "You are analyzing news articles for a Scottish heritage and culture newsletter with a primarily US-Scots diaspora audience - people of Scottish descent living in the United States, Canada, Australia, and other countries who maintain an interest in the history and culture of their \\"old country\\".\\n\\nImagine a typical reader: someone of Scottish descent living in the US, with family connections to Scotland, interested in learning about the \\"old country\\" - its history, culture, traditions, and contemporary developments that matter.\\n\\nArticle Title: A luxury spa day for two with lunch and fizz - now in the Black Friday sale with 60% off\\nURL: https://www.stornowaygazette.co.uk/recommended/wowcher-black-friday-sale-spa-day-5419269\\n\\nArticle Content (first 2000 chars):\\nThis article contains affiliate links. We may earn a small commission on items purchased through this article, but that does not affect our editorial judgement. Did you know with an ad-lite subscription to Stornoway Gazette, you get 70% fewer ads while viewing the news that matters to you. Britain\\u2019s spas are filling fast for Black Friday, and one of the standout bargains is aBannatyne Spa dayfor two that\\u2019s suddenly far cheaper than usual. Available throughWowcher\\u2019s Black Fridaypromotion, the offer is spread across 38 locations nationwide, offering a combination of spa treatments, full access to facilities, and a relaxed dining experience. This is the kind of gift I would buy for someone and hope that the person takes me with them. TheWowcher dealcomes in two main options: a 30-minute treatment per person with full spa access, lunch, prosecco, and a \\u00a310 retail voucher, now priced at \\u00a389 down from \\u00a3221.40. For those seeking a more extended pampering session, a 60-minute treatment per person with all the same perks is available from \\u00a