ble.\n\nI scored Economic Importance as 5 because there's no economic significance mentioned in the article, aside from possibly the impact of The Hive on local communities. However, this is not a major economic development that diaspora would care about.\n\nI scored Political Importance as 10 because while The Hive is part of the 'Creating Hope with Peer Support' strategy, which may have some political implications, the article doesn't delve deeply into these issues. It's more focused on presenting the work of The Hive than on discussing broader political developments.\n\nNote: I did not score any dimension above 40 due to the lack of substantial historical context, cultural significance, or economic importance in the article.","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","context":[128006,9125,128007,271,38766,1303,33025,2696,25,6790,220,2366,18,271,128009,128006,882,128007,271,2675,527,42118,3754,9908,369,264,27188,28948,323,7829,20846,449,264,15871,2326,12,3407,2469,41470,71764,10877,482,1274,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,3723,4273,11,7008,11,8494,11,323,1023,5961,889,10519,459,2802,304,279,3925,323,7829,315,872,330,820,3224,11690,52157,264,14595,6742,25,4423,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,2326,11,449,3070,13537,311,19627,11,8173,304,6975,922,279,330,820,3224,1,482,1202,3925,11,7829,11,32006,11,323,19225,26006,430,5030,382,17064,11106,25,5165,18324,369,578,69278,520,18639,1862,1934,323,4632,7195,198,3222,25,3788,1129,2185,840,333,295,6423,6973,15549,28455,88784,9809,1697,60272,31756,15548,10826,2902,535,29883,87229,14842,57047,48511,9976,2269,9672,86406,12,21791,13858,22,271,17064,9059,320,3983,220,1049,15,23861,997,7131,499,1440,449,459,1008,79582,15493,311,435,1643,11450,11,499,636,220,2031,4,17162,14058,1418,20705,279,3754,430,13146,311,499,13,578,990,315,279,69278,11,3196,304,279,6424,12541,11,32216,1268,14734,1862,649,3085,3987,11,1977,12410,11,323,8108,31398,11,8104,369,1274,889,3663,5190,18639,5326,4245,311,32873,8082,11,21934,11,323,3674,60381,13,1102,4519,439,264,1401